### Additional Terms

Under AGPLv3 Section 7, additional terms may apply to your use. These are the additional terms:

**Section 13. Remote Network Interaction**

If you modify this program, you must provide a way for users who interact with it remotely through a computer network to receive the source code of your version by providing access to the Corresponding Source from a network server at no charge, through some standard or customary means of facilitating copying of software.

This means if you run openMemo as a web service or API, you must provide users a way to download the source code of your modified version.
